{
  "tema": 6496,
  "slug": "otro-otra-adjetivo",
  "titulo": "Otro, otra, otros, otras (another, other)",
  "subtitulo": "¿Me das otro taco?",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "Otro agrees with the noun (otro, otra, otros, otras) and never takes un / una: otro café = another coffee. It can follow el, la, mis, etc. (el otro día), and it goes before numbers: otros dos = two more.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Otro** = _another, other_. It agrees with the noun: **otro, otra, otros, otras**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Another** is just **otro**. Never **un otro**: **otro café**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "_The other_ / _my other_: put the article or possessive first: **el otro día**, **la otra playa**, **mis otros amigos**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "With a number, **otro** comes first: **otros dos tacos** = _two more tacos_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Handy phrase: **otra vez** = _again_."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "¿Me das ==otro== taco, por favor?",
              "en": "Can I have another taco, please?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Quiero ==otra== cerveza.",
              "en": "I want another beer."
            },
            {
              "es": "==El otro== día vi a tu hermano en la playa.",
              "en": "The other day I saw your brother at the beach."
            },
            {
              "es": "Tengo ==otros== planes para el sábado.",
              "en": "I have other plans for Saturday."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Mis otras== plantas están en la azotea.",
              "en": "My other plants are on the roof."
            },
            {
              "es": "Necesitamos ==otras dos== sillas.",
              "en": "We need two more chairs."
            },
            {
              "es": "Vamos a intentarlo ==otra vez==.",
              "en": "Let's try it again."
            },
            {
              "es": "Busca en ==otra== tienda.",
              "en": "Look in another store."
            }
          ]
        }
